abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization and LaTeX source of a paper giving a diagrammatic and
  possible-worlds account of deductive and inductive reasoning, with Bayesian
  confirmation, defeasible inference, ordered levels, and a quantum information
  model. Every theorem of the paper is machine-checked.
